  "semanticReview": [
    "Role.camp and old constructor parameter expressly retired; Role only role/privateState, CampComponent unique actual runtime data",
    "Same initialCamp draft is installed; default Victory queries installed Camp only original fallback field; custom membership no extra query or World ctx",
    "Catalog original init/locale/render getter and receiver order retained; ()=>ctx.currentCamp() invokes source only real capture point",
    "Initial chosen draft/init and completed currentCamp fact field are distinct; retained fixedGood and F05a partial install catch preserved",
    "No-world wolf/self-destruct callback source explicit; constants may ignore it; actor entry F05a guards remain; knowledge/paid not globally filtered",
    "All nine real Observation project calls now receive required late Camp source; native capture dispatcher forwards source without evaluation",
    "Static six missing tails and unbound window world closed before checks; Role head responsibility-only fix closed first actual head red"
  ],
  "resolvedFindings": [
    "Observation six source omissions; this.world late receiver; finding-path metadata; scope-specific MD before-template precision; Role head first diagnostic"
